P Hide thy face from my sins, and blot out all
  mine iniquities. __Psal.__ li. 9.
P The sacrifices of God are a broken spirit: a
  broken and a contrite heart, O God, thou wilt
  not despise. __Psal.__ li. 17.
P Rend your heart, and not your garments, and
  turn unto the Lord your God: for he is gracious
  and merciful, slow to anger, and of great kind-
